 * the thing it describes. If the two ever disagree the row is a lie, which is
 * the same reason every colour sample on this page drives its rendered value
 * and its `data-token` from one place.
 *
 * The page title renders at a flat 4.75rem here, not the clamp the shipping h1
 * uses. A specimen exists to show the role at its size; the clamp is a
 * responsive accommodation and it is documented in global.css where it lives.
 */
